sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: WebSocket message fragmentation permits interleaved control
  accDescr: After valid 101 opening, text fragments hel and lo surround a ping and pong; one hello message results, and a later close exchange does not certify business processing.
participant C as Client
  participant S as Server
  C->>S: Valid Upgrade opening
  S-->>C: 101 + accept value
  Note over C,S: WebSocket OPEN
  S->>C: Text fragment: hel, FIN=0
  S->>C: Ping: p
  C->>S: Pong: p
  S->>C: Continuation: lo, FIN=1
  Note over C,S: One message: hello
  C->>S: Close: 1000
  S->>C: Close: 1000
  Note over C,S: Connection ends<br/>Business outcome is separate
